{"request":{"path":"/rest/contents/search","query":{"limit":3,"offset":0,"projection":"full","sort":"viewsCount:desc"},"body":{"operator":"and","filters":{"format":{"includes":["video"]},"publishedAt":{"after":"2026-06-27","before":"2026-09-27"}},"queries":[{"operator":"or","filters":{"caption":{"includesExactly":{"values":["restaurant","restaurants"],"operator":"or"}}}},{"operator":"or","filters":{"caption":{"includesExactly":{"values":["dubai"],"operator":"or"}}}},{"operator":"or","filters":{"caption":{"includesExactly":{"values":["tips","hack"],"operator":"or"}},"transcript":{"includesExactly":{"values":["tips","hack"],"operator":"or"}}}}]}},"status":200,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-27T10:25:48.362Z","response":{"data":{"aggregations":{"totalViewsCount":54788,"totalInteractionsCount":1074,"totalEngagementRatePerViews":0.019602832737095715,"totalEngagementRatePerFollowers":0.0014043548074961687},"results":[{"id":"cnt_68571102b69077d427585055a422","matchedQueries":[],"platform":"instagram","profileHandle":"justfood","profileDisplayName":"JustFood","format":"video","caption":"Here’s a Dubai dining hack worth knowing 👀\n\nYou can get up to 50% OFF your dining bills, every day. \n\nJust pick a restaurant on talabat DineOut, dine there, enter your bill amount, and your discount applies automatically at checkout. No vouchers. No coupons. Just eat, pay less, repeat. 💸\n\nWe put it to the test at Turkish Village 🇹🇷 - a spot made for those days when you’re craving a full Turkish feast.\n\nFreshly baked bread, creamy mezze, sizzling grills, Turkish classics and desserts to finish. 🤤\n\n📍 Turkish Village, Dubai\n📱 Pay via talabat DineOut\n#talabatuae #talabatDineOut #TurkishVillage #DubaiFood #DubaiRestaurants #DubaiFoodies","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_e06e485e1da727a52dc11f18d1fa","publishedAt":"2026-09-16T13:51:26.000Z","profileId":"prf_65e94488e5728b3d4e4af1e926cb","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DdWbwqoktDk/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":30745,"likesCount":491,"sharesCount":175,"commentsCount":10,"interactionsCount":676,"engagementRatePerViews":2.1987315010570825,"engagementRatePerFollowers":0.1420147182709498,"profileFollowersCount":476007,"profileFollowingCount":6102,"profilePostsCount":1338,"mediaCount":1,"duration":29.093,"hashtags":["#talabatuae","#talabatdineout","#turkishvillage","#dubaifood","#dubairestaurants","#dubaifoodies"],"coAuthors":[],"mentions":[],"platformId":"DdWbwqoktDk","profilePlatformId":"26405008984","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/justfood/pfp.webp","profileBio":"🍕No Nonsense, Just Food \n🏆 Top 3 Food Guide UAE, TikTok(200K)\n📥 Email alex@zodiacglobal.com for enquiries \n🏠Co-Founder @aatishdubai 👇\n📱LN:7032941","profileVerified":true,"locationPlatformId":null,"locationCompleteAddress":null,"locationLatitude":null,"locationLongitude":null,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"We can all agree that dining out in Dubai is getting expensive. So how about up to 50% off some of the best restaurants in town with Dine Out on Talabat. For example, Turkish Village is one of the OG restaurants serving authentic Turkish cuisine and you can get 20% off your entire bill and it is ridiculously simple to use. Just open the Talabat app, click the Dine Out feature, search for the restaurant and type in your bill. The discount gets automatically applied and all you have to do is pay through the Talabat app to get it. This is just one of many offers so check out the full list of discounts on Talabat.","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.173,"endSeconds":3.213,"text":"We can all agree that dining out in Dubai is getting expensive."},{"startSeconds":3.213,"endSeconds":7.653,"text":"So how about up to 50% off some of the best restaurants in town with Dine Out on Talabat."},{"startSeconds"