 guyss 🧡✨ go have a lookk","likesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"publishedAt":"2026-09-16T13:51:26.000Z","createdAt":"2026-09-21T05:59:37.044Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T05:59:37.044Z"},{"platformId":"18127070263744856","profilePlatformId":"353243701","profileHandle":"dannyagg_","content":"👏👏👏👏","likesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"publishedAt":"2026-09-16T13:51:26.000Z","createdAt":"2026-09-21T05:59:37.044Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T05:59:37.044Z"}],"createdAt":"2026-09-20T16:27:42.125Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-23T15:54:58.242Z"},{"id":"cnt_6f3e2f4692bf9e8a5b6bdc4e18e6","matchedQueries":[],"platform":"tiktok","profileHandle":"dubaixplorebites","profileDisplayName":"DXB- DubaiXploreBites","format":"video","caption":"Expensive V/S Affordable (DUBAI VERSION) ‼️🤯 1️⃣ 𝗔𝗖𝗧𝗜𝗩𝗜𝗧𝗜𝗘𝗦 𝗘𝗫𝗣𝗘𝗡𝗦𝗜𝗩𝗘: Paying gate prices for tours, jet skis, safaris, and random “tourist packages.” 𝗔𝗙𝗙𝗢𝗥𝗗𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘: Using Audora for exclusive deals, flash discounts, and hidden-gem activities locals never mention. 2️⃣ 𝗕𝗘𝗔𝗖𝗛 𝗗𝗔𝗬𝗦 𝗘𝗫𝗣𝗘𝗡𝗦𝗜𝗩𝗘: Booking day passes at luxury beach clubs every weekend. 𝗔𝗙𝗙𝗢𝗥𝗗𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘: Public beaches like JBR, Kite Beach, and Al Sufouh — identical views, free entry, same sunset magic. 3️⃣ 𝗚𝗘𝗧𝗧𝗜𝗡𝗚 𝗔𝗥𝗢𝗨𝗡𝗗 𝗘𝗫𝗣𝗘𝗡𝗦𝗜𝗩𝗘: Taking taxis everywhere and during surge hours. 𝗔𝗙𝗙𝗢𝗥𝗗𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘: Metro for long routes + Careem for short hops + Google Maps to avoid heat traps and detours. 4️⃣ 𝗩𝗜𝗘𝗪𝗦 𝗢𝗙 𝗧𝗛𝗘 𝗦𝗞𝗬𝗟𝗜𝗡𝗘 𝗘𝗫𝗣𝗘𝗡𝗦𝗜𝗩𝗘: Paying full price for Burj Khalifa tickets. 𝗔𝗙𝗙𝗢𝗥𝗗𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘: Rooftop cafés, Burj Park, or JBR — same skyline, zero entrance fees. 5️⃣ 𝗙𝗢𝗢𝗗 𝗘𝗫𝗣𝗘𝗡𝗦𝗜𝗩𝗘: Eating only in Downtown or Marina restaurants. 𝗔𝗙𝗙𝗢𝗥𝗗𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘: Bur Dubai, Karama, and local cafeterias — insane food at a fraction of the cost. 6️⃣ 𝗚𝗥𝗢𝗖𝗘𝗥𝗜𝗘𝗦 𝗘𝗫𝗣𝗘𝗡𝗦𝗜𝗩𝗘: Buying snacks and drinks at tourist spots. 𝗔𝗙𝗙𝗢𝗥𝗗𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘: Carrefour & Lulu with crazy 1+1 deals and receipt coupons locals quietly stack. 7️⃣ 𝗧𝗥𝗔𝗡𝗦𝗣𝗢𝗥𝗧𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡 𝗖𝗢𝗠𝗙𝗢𝗥𝗧 𝗘𝗫𝗣𝗘𝗡𝗦𝗜𝗩𝗘: Premium car services for every ride. 𝗔𝗙𝗙𝗢𝗥𝗗𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘: Yango / Bolt — clean rides, often close to Hala Taxi prices but more reliable. 8️⃣ 𝗘𝗡𝗧𝗘𝗥𝗧𝗔𝗜𝗡𝗠𝗘𝗡𝗧 𝗡𝗜𝗚𝗛𝗧𝗦 𝗘𝗫𝗣𝗘𝗡𝗦𝗜𝗩𝗘: Big-name lounges and weekend-only hotspots. 𝗔𝗙𝗙𝗢𝗥𝗗𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘: Weekday gems in Business Bay, JLT, or DIFC — same vibe, half the price, no crowds. 9️⃣ 𝗟𝗔𝗨𝗡𝗗𝗥𝗬 𝗘𝗫𝗣𝗘𝗡𝗦𝗜𝗩𝗘: Hotel laundry or overpriced walk-in shops. 𝗔𝗙𝗙𝗢𝗥𝗗𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘: Washmen — door pickup, dry cleaning, and better value than most tourist options. [Tourists In Dubai, Dubai Trip, Dubai Metro, Dubai Tourists, Travelling To Dubai, Dubai Hacks, Dubai Tips, Things To Do In Dubai]","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_3a0deab4c25ac2d8d1b11dac0c97","publishedAt":"2026-07-01T16:45:53.000Z","profileId":"prf_996bcfdf59ba18c3afbaa39841ed","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7657601762194509076/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":13400,"likesCount":211,"sharesCount":30,"commentsCount":0,"interactionsCount":241,"engagementRatePerViews":1.7985074626865671,"engagementRatePerFollowers":2.1517857142857144,"profileFollowersCount":17800,"profileFollowingCount":0,"profilePostsCount":356,"mediaCount":1,"duration":11,"hashtags":[],"coAuthors":[],"mentions":[],"platformId":"7657601762194509076","profilePlatformId":"7370657995976131600","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/dubaixplorebites/pfp.webp","profileBio":"Email: dubaixplorebites@gmail.com","profileVerified":false,"locationPlatformId":null,"locationCompleteAddress":null,"locationLatitude":null,"locationLongitude":null,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"you","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.001,"endSeconds":11.001,"text":"you"}],"frames":[{"id":"med_9b1eb8996662065a66e7293297c5","position":1,"timestampSeconds":0,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7657601762194509076/1_0.00.webp"},{"id":"med_eec02fb73ee387433b797ca5ecd5","position":2,"timestampSeconds":0.01,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7657601762194509076/2_0.01.webp"},{"id":"med_d67290401ecd0e8131ffeef6b4d2","position":3,"timestampSeconds":0.01,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7657601762194509076/3_0.01.webp"},{"id":"med_154576aa064264352aaf19c29436","position":4,"timestampSeconds":0.02,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7657601762194509076/4_0.02.webp"}],"audioPlatformId":"7657601790380313362","audioTitle":"original sound","audioAuthor":"DXB- DubaiXploreBites","audioType":"original","audioCopyrighted":false,"popularComments":[],"createdAt":"2026-07-01T18:44:40.084Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-08T02:26:03.317Z"},{"id":"cnt_14f8a7e146bc32dbe1c9c9f2ed19","matchedQueries":[],"platform":"instagram","profileHandle":"cloudninecouture","profileDisplayName":"Hiba | Food and Travel Content","format":"video","caption":"I can’t tell you guys how obsessed I am with my Aura Pass 😭\nHere are all the details so you can save too ⬇️\nSign up for the Aura pass on the @aura_rewards app\nCosts AED 199 and is valid till the end of the year \nYou can register till 30th August \nYou can avail 30% off restaurants like Pf Chang’s, Cheesecake Factory, Pinkberry and so many more. \nYou also get 30% off multiple stores, offer valid on full price items. \n\nOne of my favorite purchases this year 🙌🏼\n\n( Dubai , shopping , Hack , AURA ,foodie , UAE , rewards, sale, offers , share and save )\n\n#dubailife #wheretovisit #uae #mydubai","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_9156ad3216f800929ca62099a3e9","publishedAt":"2026-08-25T13:11:46.000Z","profileId":"prf_52885dcc2e5c6d52e8ae3f7094df","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dcds7nrocYn/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":4328,"likesCount":3,"sharesCount":62,"commentsCount":21,"interactionsCount":86,"engagementRatePerViews":1.9870609981515712,"engagementRatePerFollowers":0.18982452267961594,"profileFollowersCount":45305,"profileFollowingCount":1266,"profilePos